<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KNIRV Network: Join Us in Building the Future of AI</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Sans+Pro:wght@300;400;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@2.2.19/dist/tailwind.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free@6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;
            color: #ffffff;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .slide {
            width: 1280px;
            min-height: 720px;
            max-height: 720px;
            position: relative;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.95), rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.9)), 
                        url('https://picsum.photos/seed/future-ai-technology/1280/720.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .header {
            padding: 40px 70px 20px;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 56px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        .title::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 0;
            width: 80px;
            height: 4px;
            background-color: #7c3aed;
        }
        .content {
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            padding: 20px 70px 40px;
        }
        .left-section {
            width: 60%;
            padding-right: 30px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .right-section {
            width: 40%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .tagline-box {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .tagline-box:hover {
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .tagline {
            font-size: 24px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            font-weight: 400;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #7c3aed;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .highlights-box {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            flex-grow: 1;
            border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .highlights-box:hover {
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #7c3aed;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .section-title i {
            margin-right: 12px;
            font-size: 28px;
        }
        .highlights-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .highlight-item {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .highlight-item:hover {
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }
        .highlight-icon {
            color: #7c3aed;
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .highlight-value {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #7c3aed;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .highlight-label {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .contact-box {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .contact-box:hover {
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .contact-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .contact-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .contact-item:hover {
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }
        .contact-icon {
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
            color: #7c3aed;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin-right: 15px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .contact-text {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .cta-box {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .cta-box:hover {
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .cta-text {
            font-size: 24px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .cta-button {
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #7c3aed;
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .cta-button i {
            margin-left: 10px;
        }
        .logo-placeholder {
            position: absolute;
            top: 30px;
            right: 70px;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #7c3aed;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .logo-placeholder i {
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        .keyword {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.15);
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 2px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .accent-circle {
            position: absolute;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.15) 0%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0) 70%);
            z-index: 0;
        }
        .accent-circle-1 {
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            top: -150px;
            right: -100px;
        }
        .accent-circle-2 {
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            bottom: -100px;
            left: -100px;
        }
        /* Mobile responsive breakpoints */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .slide {
                padding: 3vh 4vw;
            }
            .content {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vh, 2rem);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .slide {
                padding: 2vh 3vw;
            }
            .title {
                font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 6vw, 2.2rem);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="slide">
        <div class="accent-circle accent-circle-1"></div>
        <div class="accent-circle accent-circle-2"></div>
        
        <div class="logo-placeholder">
            <i class="fas fa-cube"></i>
            KNIRV
        </div>
        
        <div class="header">
            <h1 class="title">Join Us in Building the Future of AI</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="left-section">
                <div class="tagline-box">
                    <div class="tagline">
                        KNIRV is positioned to become the 
                        <span class="keyword">foundational infrastructure</span> 
                        for the next generation of 
                        <span class="keyword">autonomous AI agents</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="highlights-box">
                    <div class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                        Key Investment Highlights
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="highlights-grid">
                        <div class="highlight-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-chart-line highlight-icon"></i>
                            <div class="highlight-value">$335.8B</div>
                            <div class="highlight-label">Market opportunity by 2030</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="highlight-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-dollar-sign highlight-icon"></i>
                            <div class="highlight-value">$550M</div>
                            <div class="highlight-label">Projected revenue by Year 5</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="highlight-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-sitemap highlight-icon"></i>
                            <div class="highlight-value">12 Layers</div>
                            <div class="highlight-label">Unique technological advantages</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="highlight-item">
                            <i class="fas fa-users highlight-icon"></i>
                            <div class="highlight-value">400+</div>
                            <div class="highlight-label">Experienced team by Year 5</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="right-section">
                <div class="contact-box">
                    <div class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
                        Contact Information
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="contact-list">
                        <div class="contact-item">
                            <div class="contact-icon">
                                <i class="fas fa-globe"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="contact-text">knirv.com</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="contact-item">
                            <div class="contact-icon">
                                <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="contact-text">investors@knirv.com</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="cta-box">
                    <div class="cta-text">
                        Let's discuss how you can participate in the 
                        <span class="keyword">decentralized AI revolution</span>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="cta-button">
                        Schedule a Meeting
                        <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>